# The four Moxen are cast earlier this turn, so they satisfy Gray and Adira's condition at the beginning of combat (CR 601.2i, 603.4).
# At the beginning of combat Gray copies itself. The token is not legendary, has haste now, and is sacrificed at the next
# end step; the original remains (CR 707.2, 707.9b, 702.10b, 603.7c, 400.7).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Island
Gray and Adira, Forever Joined
Ornithopter
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

